Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: xyz project <tomaz.stih@wischner.co.uk>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Description: x compiler suite for z80
 xcc, xas, xopt, xar, xld, xobjcopy, xgdb, xgdb-z80, compiler runtime
 libraries, staged headers, static helper libraries, and documentation.
 The package installs the suite under /opt/x and exposes /opt/x/bin through
 /etc/profile.d/x.sh for new login shells.
